	(text "Slave level shifters. Address, data out, and strobes are received by 74LVC245A (bus on B, direction held low, output enable held low). Data in is driven by 74ACT245 (FPGA on A, direction held at 5 V). The two data output enables are pulled to 3.3 V so both transceivers stay off while the FPGA configures, and so an FPGA pin is never pulled to 5 V. RESET* and POC* use TN0702 translators. The FPGA only listens on those two nets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
